283
00:25:04.650 --> 00:25:07.380
Mutrivõti vesti alta muti.

284
00:25:09.000 --> 00:25:15.850
Alt ta, vaata ka, vaata vennike,
vaata, vennike, neil on kust

285
00:25:15.850 --> 00:25:19.259
ja ra ada, neil on rikkust

286
00:25:19.359 --> 00:25:23.290
